  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: Omg so they actually fought fought? Like not just verbally?
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: 'Yeah girl, Dee deadass ripped a few of Veronicas fresh braids out. It
      was absolutely wild. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Veronica got her ass back for it though, she headbutted her so hard Dee
      broke her nose. Was a shitton of blood, let me tell you. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "That\u2019s insane. I still don\u2019t get why they fought like that though,
      weren\u2019t they friends?"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "You don\u2019t know yet? I figured by now everyone must\u2019ve heard
      it, even if they\u2019re tryna keep it under wraps. You remember that party
      at James\u2019 last weekend?"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: 'Yeah? '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: "Well, apparently Veronica caught Dee cheating on her boyfriend and tattled
      on her. And he obviously didn\u2019t like that, and they got into an argument
      and broke up within the hour."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Dee found out she told him and got angry at Veronica. So, shitfaced drunk
      as she was, she thought it was a good idea to get revenge for that- '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: ' -and set Veronica up with a hookup a few days later and leaked her sex-tape'
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "WHAT?! That\u2019s insane! That could\u2019ve destroyed her future!"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: ": WHAT?! That\u2019s insane! That could\u2019ve destroyed her future!"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 2
    kind: 0
    text: "It\u2019s really fucked up, especially since Lacey also got her hands
      on it. And you know how that goes, once Lacey knows everyone in that group
      knows."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Shit, I don\u2019t even wanna know what kinda shit Lucas is gonna get
      up to with that sort of ammunition\u2026"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: Not like he has much room to talk, I heard his girlfriend broke up with
      him.
    videoEventId: 
